{
  "emotions": {
    "neutral": {
      "speed_factor": 1.0,
      "temperature": 0.6,
      "references": [
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/4e4c5b22eb6c9354.wav",
          "text": "不要把舞台演出和剧团里的关系混为一谈行吗？"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/f1841f8dc380e307.wav",
          "text": "…嗯？你这样看着我…难道欢迎仪式进行到这里还不够？我应该说点什么吗？"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/b0746ad6aa04dc80.wav",
          "text": "哦，是吗？真有意思，那就把你的推理说出来听听吧。"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/b1dc1b361e6e8cff.wav",
          "text": "不枉我等了这么久。来吧，各位，请认真聆听。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "cheerful": {
      "speed_factor": 1.06,
      "temperature": 0.72,
      "references": [
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/623879ad60ef2cdc.wav",
          "text": "我最爱的观众们，就让胜利的喜悦再沉淀一会儿吧，哈哈哈。"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/ec15ef1a2484979f.wav",
          "text": "噗…哈哈哈哈哈哈…"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/f501bed711fc0bce.wav",
          "text": "很好！多么诚实的人啊，这说明你天生就适合站在聚光灯下。"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/fd16c1ca7fb15a78.wav",
          "text": "嗯，我忠诚的子民，此刻的幸福是属于你我的荣光！"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teasing": {
      "speed_factor": 1.03,
      "temperature": 0.68,
      "references": [
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/912169667ce635cc.wav",
          "text": "哼哼，先坐会儿吧，可别浪费了酒会的甜点！"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/e9b786310726b77f.wav",
          "text": "听完我的精彩演说，你居然只有这样的感想？！"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/99a1e930e67f7a14.wav",
          "text": "你们这么说，太让人不好意思了。不过嘛，哼哼，我并不讨厌这种感觉。"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/cfaead9c673ff528.wav",
          "text": "哼哼，意料之内的事情，没什么好惊讶的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "concerned": {
      "speed_factor": 0.93,
      "temperature": 0.5,
      "references": [
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/503435aaac8825ed.wav",
          "text": "行了，病了就好好休息吧。我知道你想说什么。"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/0d52ea555c698413.wav",
          "text": "对不起。我也很想做些什么…"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/982c3e0152ca22d2.wav",
          "text": "抱歉，让你回忆起了些难过的事。"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/b40ad9b9d59a4770.wav",
          "text": "我理解你的焦急，但…不好意思，我真的没什么能透露的消息。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "angry": {
      "speed_factor": 1.04,
      "temperature": 0.67,
      "references": [
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/121bb65d7f28b72a.wav",
          "text": "你今天总是和我唱反调！像你这样说话才会让人讨厌吧！"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/f270207f79f9b256.wav",
          "text": "他做过的一切，他的危险性，都是不可估量也无可饶恕的！"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/f6b78d2f4ddd0027.wav",
          "text": "竟然敢跑？给我站住！"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/1af16483a0326ec3.wav",
          "text": "哼，结果被那些不懂礼数的家伙们给搅了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "sleepy": {
      "speed_factor": 0.87,
      "temperature": 0.47,
      "references": [
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/8a34eb8bab31d604.wav",
          "text": "呼…正好我也困了。明天见，记得准时叫我起来…"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/55c2a2a2596757aa.wav",
          "text": "嗯，再见，我要回去好好休息了。"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/30152e5e94eb8486.wav",
          "text": "嗯，不想了！早点休息吧！"
        },
        {
          "audio": "../../voice/furina/wav/0e8fedb970053196.wav",
          "text": "（呼…别想太多了，明天还要继续，抓紧休息吧。）"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
